                                                  rdfs:comment "Represents the relation of referring a curriculum to a module that is part of that curriculum."@en ;
                                                  rdfs:label "has module"@en .


###  https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/hasPreviousLearningStep
<https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/hasPreviousLearningStep> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
