                                                      rdfs:label "has profession"@en .


###  https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/hasRecomended
<https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/hasRecomended> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                      rdfs:domain <https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Media> ;
