                                                                                                           ] ;
                                                rdfs:comment "Represents an Article is a written media resource, typed as a sub-class."@en ;
                                                rdfs:label "Article"@en .


###  https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Audience
<https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Audience> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla-sd#entityPosition> [ <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla-sd#entityPositionX> "196.46726312554472"^^xsd:double ;
