                                                                                                  <https://archive.org/services/purl/domain/modular_ontology_design_library/role-dependent-name> .


###  https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Curriculum
<https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Curriculum> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                     owl:onProperty <https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/hasModule> ;
