                                                                                                              ] ;
                                                   rdfs:comment "Represents a Curriculum as a curated course of study that groups modules into a coherent educational offering."@en ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Curriculum"@en ;
                                                   <https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/isNativeTo> <https://archive.org/services/purl/domain/modular_ontology_design_library/namestub> .


###  https://kastle-lab.org/currkg/lod/ont/Event
